			"notes": "Initial public release for Minecraft 1.21.1 on Fabric.\n\n**Installation:** Fabric Loader for 1.21.1, [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api), and this jar in your `mods/` directory. Works on clients and dedicated servers.\n\nIncludes the complete equivalent-exchange loop: the EMC engine, Transmutation Table and Tablet, condensers, collectors, relays, matter furnaces and pedestals, dark/red matter equipment, the gem armor set, rings and amulets, klein stars, and alchemical fuels. See the [README](https://github.com/whoisaldo/EternalExchange#readme) for details and current limitations.\n\nMarked as pre-release pending wider play-testing. Please report issues via the [issue tracker](https://github.com/whoisaldo/EternalExchange/issues)."
